      "description": "Postponed Fate (Immediate Action, 1/hour): When you fail a save against emotion control, mind control, or a condition (Blind, Slowed, etc.), delay the effect for 3 rounds. Eyes of the Oracle (1/hour): React to an enemy action as if you had readied an action.",
